===Etymology===
Arabic {{Arab|[[عيد الاضحى]]}} ''‘īd al-ađħa''.

===Proper noun===
'''Eid ul-Adha'''

# an [[Islamic]] [[festival]] commemorating the [[prophet]] [[Ibrahim]]'s willingness to [[sacrifice]] his son [[Ismail]] to [[Allah]]

